		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Il faut utiliser l&#039;ordre SQL EXECUTE. Quelque chose du genre :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION f1(nom_table text)
RETURNS int4
LANGUAGE plpgsql
AS $$
DECLARE
  requete text;
BEGIN
  requete := &#039;SELECT .... FROM &#039; || nom_table | &#039;...&#039;;
  EXECUTE requete;
  RETURN 1;
END;
$$;</code></pre></div>]]></content>
